<task id="090" project="unified-access-control-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>Project wrap-up: test-diet gate, register closeout (H-8a/H-8b), defer/issue disposition gate, lessons learned, README Complete</title>
    <phase>Wrap-up</phase>
    <gate>blocked — requires ALL prior tasks (Phases 0-5, FR-33, governance and register-driven tasks) completed</gate>
    <status>pending</status>
    <rigor>STANDARD</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Mostly docs/process; the H-8a/H-8b code touches are comment + vestigial-DTO cleanup scoped by an escalation trigger (behavioral change is out of bounds). /test-diet itself is read-only.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Checklist-driven closure; no design judgment beyond the scoped cleanups.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>medium</effort>
